            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gli orari restano come li imposti, senza scambi tra mattina e pomeriggio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Times stay as you set them: morning never swaps with afternoon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I voti peggiori escono interi, dal più basso, finché restano CFU eliminabili. I CFU restano acquisiti." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The worst grades leave whole, lowest first, while credits to leave out remain. Their credits stay earned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
